  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Anyone who's spent time as the beeg-club-fynn at Furality can tell you that the Medium restriction on avis is allowing amazing things to be practical. We're currently sitting at a snug 150 people and graphically it's still solid.\n\nIt would be nice if we could take the rules that make beeg club fynn possible and open it up to regular world hosts, allowing for higher than 80 people when using a performance rank gate (on large worlds where that makes sense). Maybe not 150 people for medium rank, but nice bumps up from 80 for playing nice with avi limits. It would encourage both world hosts and users to optimize.",
